# NestJS backend conventions

- Keep controllers thin in `src/*/*.controller.ts`.
- Put Prisma access in `src/*/*.service.ts` via `src/prisma.service.ts`.
- Reuse `Prisma` types from `@prisma/client` for `@Body()` payloads.
- Preserve module wiring in `src/*/*.module.ts`.
- Keep `pt-BR` identifiers and comments consistent with existing files.
- Keep `chat`, `equipe`, and `preferencias` module wiring aligned with `src/app.module.ts`.
